    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/2a4f8f408e30f52ad0721dff12b3c40f.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen Wars: Appetiser <strong>is the prologue version of the full game Kitchen Wars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Appetiser version is just a 60-minute gameplay of the full game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/9472e1c26005683d6ebff26293248051.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your clients: Quickly prepare and deliver meals to keep customers happy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades and items: Improve your kitchen, unlock boosters, and get the edge on your opponent. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack the opposing restaurant: Use melee weapons to disrupt your rival's operations and steal their resources. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal chairs: Sabotage the other restaurant by swiping their chairs, reducing their seating capacity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your restaurant: Earn money from satisfied clients to invest in your kitchen and improve your chances of winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/e20be1beebfd54869007f47907ad5db7.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Remote Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/2a4f8f408e30f52ad0721dff12b3c40f.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen Wars: Appetiser <strong>is the prologue version of the full game Kitchen Wars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Appetiser version is just a 60-minute gameplay of the full game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/f8dbdedbc3c0bdf7c880c93f5a64e23a.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/9472e1c26005683d6ebff26293248051.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your clients: Quickly prepare and deliver meals to keep customers happy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades and items: Improve your kitchen, unlock boosters, and get the edge on your opponent. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack the opposing restaurant: Use melee weapons to disrupt your rival's operations and steal their resources. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal chairs: Sabotage the other restaurant by swiping their chairs, reducing their seating capacity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your restaurant: Earn money from satisfied clients to invest in your kitchen and improve your chances of winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/c40d052090481f422fb9ca5ba4c1a4f6.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/e20be1beebfd54869007f47907ad5db7.avif?t=1743681299\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Remote Play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.poster.avif?t=1743681299\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.webm?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366010/extras/8048965b807da73d4763b723f3b9c477.mp4?t=1743681299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
